[agent] **What was delivered:**
[agent] - `rawa8af783` v1 (250 rows) and `rawb8af783` v1 (240 rows), primary key `row_id`, loaded from the two CSVs.
[agent] - `derived8af783` v1 with exactly `row_id, col_sum`, primary key `row_id`, 189 rows — the inner-join intersection of the two raw tables, with `col_sum = round(a_val + b_val, 6)`. It is **online-enabled** (available for low-latency lookup) and its lineage is registered via feature-group `parents`; reading it back confirms parents `[('rawa8af783', 1), ('rawb8af783', 1)]`.
